# L §4.6 steps 2 and 3, §6.4 (tally 2.1.7 R4, issue #143; #137): a base reading restated with replace known in
# March, after a scenario's replace of it known in February: the scenario's stands (200.00 PLN), since a layer
# stands above what it is written over. 2.1.6's refcore kept the base's restatement (150.00 PLN). (T's C15.)
=== m.tally
model rs
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-10
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T C15 (invented): a base reading restated with replace known in March, after a scenario's replace of it known in February, one place and instant; the scenario's stands (L §6.4, §4.6 step 2; issue #137; gate 8's open survivor, reading.rs replaced)"

source card "invented"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

ask q: bal(konto, 2026-01-15) in rs

ask qr: bal(konto, 2026-01-15) in restate

version v1
  cite card
  governs 2026-01
  known 2026-01-20
  anchor konto
  opening[konto] = 0 at 2026-01-01 start "base"
  stated[konto] = 100 at 2026-01-15 end "base, January"

version v2
  cite card
  governs 2026-01
  known 2026-03-05
  anchor konto
  replace stated[konto] = 150 at 2026-01-15 end "base, restated in March"
=== alt.tally
scenario restate over rs
  tally 2
  from 2026-01-01
  note "T C15 (invented): its replace known in February (issue #137)"

version restate_v
  cite card
  governs 2026-01
  known 2026-02-10
  anchor konto
  replace stated[konto] = 200 at 2026-01-15 end "the scenario"
=== expect
q: 150.00 PLN
  world: rs
  anchor: konto 2026-01-15 end, stated 150.00 PLN, difference 150.00 PLN
  cut 2026-03-10
qr: 200.00 PLN
  world: restate
  anchor: konto 2026-01-15 end, stated 200.00 PLN, difference 200.00 PLN
  cut 2026-03-10
